                <td style="padding: 14px 18px; font-weight: bold;">Daily Financial Cost</td>
                <td style="padding: 14px 18px;">€45 – €85 (Car) + €35 (Fuel) + €15 (Zero-Deductible Insurance) + €10 (Tolls & Parking) = <strong>€105 – €145 / day</strong></td>
                <td style="padding: 14px 18px;"><strong>€140 – €220 / day</strong> (All fuel, tolls, insurance, and chauffeur fees completely included)</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td style="padding: 14px 18px; font-weight: bold;">Security Deposit Risk</td>
                <td style="padding: 14px 18px;">€1,500 – €2,500 credit card hold. High risk of disputes over pre-existing scratches or rock chips.</td>
                <td style="padding: 14px 18px;"><strong>€0 deposit hold.</strong> Zero liability for mechanical wear, tire punctures, or windshield chips.</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td style="padding: 14px 18px; font-weight: bold;">Mountain & Pass Navigation</td>
                <td style="padding: 14px 18px;">White-knuckle stress on blind hairpin turns over Tizi n'Tichka. Heavy overloaded trucks, rockfall zones, and oncoming traffic.</td>
                <td style="padding: 14px 18px;"><strong>Zero stress.</strong> Relax in an elevated seat, take photos, or nap while an expert mountain driver navigates smoothly.</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td style="padding: 14px 18px; font-weight: bold;">Police Checkpoints & Speed Traps</td>
                <td style="padding: 14px 18px;">Morocco has frequent radar checkpoints at city entrances. Unfamiliar tourists frequently receive cash fines for minor speed infractions.</td>
                <td style="padding: 14px 18px;"><strong>Effortless passage.</strong> Professional tourist transport permits are recognized and waved through checkpoints respectfully.</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td style="padding: 14px 18px; font-weight: bold;">Medina Arrival & Parking</td>
                <td style="padding: 14px 18px;">Cars are strictly prohibited inside historic medinas (Marrakech, Fes). Finding secure overnight parking outside city gates is confusing and costly.</td>
                <td style="padding: 14px 18px;"><strong>Door-to-door coordination.</strong> Your driver coordinates with your riad staff to have luggage porters meet you at the nearest gate.</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td style="padding: 14px 18px; font-weight: bold;">Sightseeing Pacing</td>
                <td style="padding: 14px 18px;">The driver in your group must keep their eyes glued to the asphalt and cannot enjoy the panoramic views.</td>
                <td style="padding: 14px 18px;"><strong>100% enjoyable for all passengers.</strong> Stop whenever you spot a panoramic viewpoint, wild camel herd, or roadside café.</td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>

