        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions About Private Drivers in Morocco</h2>

        <div style="margin-bottom: 24px;">
          <h3 style="font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 19px; font-weight: 800; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 8px;">
            How far in advance should I book a private driver in Morocco?
          </h3>
          <p>
            For travel during high season (March to May and September to November, as well as Christmas and New Year), we recommend booking <strong>6 to 12 weeks in advance</strong> to secure top-tier English-speaking drivers and modern Prado 4x4 or Mercedes vehicles. For low season travel (July, August, January), 2 to 3 weeks notice is generally sufficient.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-bottom: 24px;">
          <h3 style="font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 19px; font-weight: 800; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 8px;">
            Can our private driver book our luxury riads and desert camps for us?
          </h3>
          <p>
            Yes! While you are completely welcome to book your own accommodations and hire our driver for transport only, most travelers prefer our <strong>custom private tour packages</strong>. Because we work directly with premier riads and boutique desert camps year-round, we often secure preferential room upgrades, guaranteed private en-suite bathrooms, and better package rates than booking platforms.
          </p>
        </div>

